#!/system/bin/sh
# Called by busybox inotifyd: $1 = event, $2 = watched dir, $3 = file name.
DIR="$(dirname "$(realpath "$0")")"
# shellcheck source=common.sh
. "$DIR/common.sh"

case "$3" in
disable | remove) ;;
*) exit 0 ;;
esac

case "$1" in
n)
	log Info "Module ${3} flag set, stopping tailscaled."
	"${TS_SCRIPTS_DIR}/tailscaled.service" stop
	;;
d)
	module_disabled && exit 0
	log Info "Module ${3} flag cleared, starting tailscaled."
	"${TS_SCRIPTS_DIR}/tailscaled.service" start
	;;
esac
